{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261129/photo/bkn-20261129011641933-1129_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261129015505\"/><p>私家車噴出火舌。</p><p>今日（29日）凌晨零時43分，一輛私家車沿赤鱲角順朗路往機場方向行駛，期間冒煙起火，火勢猛烈，司機隨即將車停泊路旁後跳車逃生。消防員接報趕至拖喉撲救，約20分鐘後將火救熄，私家車嚴重焚毀。經初步調查，相信私家車引擎過熱引起火警，並無可疑。事件中，無人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T18:02:38.338600+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T17:16:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:56:08.078209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T17:56:08.078209+00:00","content_hash":"d49e91d59c22393d8253dc42a15e7a1cd656a8e121bd62fad968c35a53ae5493","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}